  "job_B8.1.4.2_20251003_114807": {
    "chunk_text": "w\u00e6\u00f0 to Moyse: Nu ic gesette \u00fee Pharaone to Gode, & Aaron \u00fein bro\u00f0or by\u00f0 \u00f0in witega. \u00deu sprecst ealle \u00fea \u00feing \u00fee ic \u00f0e bebeode, & he spryc\u00f0 to Pharaone, \u00fe\u00e6t he forl\u00e6te Israhela folc of hys & ic ahyrde his heortan \u00fe\u00e6t he hy nele forl\u00e6tan & ic gem\u00e6nifealde mine tacnu & mine forebeacnu on & he eow ne gehyr\u00f0, & ic asende mine hand ofer Egypta land & ut al\u00e6de minne here & min folc, & \u00fea Egyptyscan witan \u00fe\u00e6t ic eom Drihten, \u00fee ic strecce mine hand ofer Egypta land & ut al\u00e6de Witodlice Moyses & Aaron dydon eal swa Drihten him bebead. So\u00f0lice Moises w\u00e6s hundeahtatigwintre, & Aaron \u00fereo & hundeahtatigwintre \u00fea hy sp\u00e6con to & Drihten cw\u00e6\u00f0 to Moyse & to Aarone: \u00feonne Pharao inc gesyh\u00f0, \u00feonne cwe\u00f0 he to inc: Wyrcea\u00f0 Witodlice \u00fea Moyse & Aaron eodon to Faraone, \u00fea didon hy swa Drihten hym bebead; & Aaron nam So\u00f0lice Pharao gegadorode ealle \u00fea drycr\u00e6ftegustan men, & hy worhton o\u00feer swilc \u00f0yng \u00feurh heora & hy wurpon ealle heora gyrda ny\u00f0er, & hy wurdon to n\u00e6ddrum, ac Aarones gyrd forswealh ealle \u00dea gebealh Pharao hine, & ne let hi faran na swa Drihten hym bebead. So\u00f0lice Drihten cw\u00e6\u00f0 to Moyse: Pharaones heorte ys gehefegod; nele he myn folc forl\u00e6tan. Ga to him to morgen \u00feone he ut g\u00e6\u00fe to \u00fe",
